s realised **exactly** as \\(k=n-1\\) (the extra “\\(-2\\)” comes from the fact that we have added the non‑sunny line \\(\\ell_n\\)).  \nNo other integer can occur.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n### 6.  Final answer\n\nPutting together the results of Sections 3 and 5 we obtain\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\n\\begin{cases}\nk\\in\\{0,1,3\\}, & n=3,\\\\[2mm]\nk\\in\\{0,1,n-1\\}, & n\\ge 4 .\n\\end{cases}}\n\\]"
